dialogueText = Array[String](["Master! We meet again.", "Daichi, since you are here, one last detail about this mansion.", "I'm all ears master!", "The door you just opened by finding the keys in this area, is used to seal a special type of key.", "Special key? What about it?", "To access the area where Gozo, the master of this mansion is, you'll need to collect all of those special keys.", "Oh... that sounds annoy- great!", "Be wary Daichi, we are not in a normal room right now. This is a chaotic space created by Gozo's magic. Elements inside of this area are messy.", "Hmhm, I will keep my eyes peeled!", "Good luck, Daichi.", "Thank you, master!"])
